  "prefLabel": "Alc 101.01 Purpose of the Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 101.01 Purpose of the Rules. These rules implement the statutory responsibilities of the board of licensing for alcohol and other drug use professionals. Their purpose is to protect and benefit the public through the regulation of such professionals.\n\nSource. #8169, eff 9-21-04; ss by 9417, eff 3-14-09; ss by #14585, eff 6-1-26",
